WEBVTT

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:04.230
<i>You ever heard of being
reincarnated in another world?</i>

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:08.720
<i>I don't know why, or how,</i>

00:00:09.270 --> 00:00:12.230
<i>but I died due to a god's mistake,</i>

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:16.240
<i>and now I'm being sent to live
a new life in a new world.</i>

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:22.630
<i>Did you know the Goddess of
Reincarnation is really hot?</i>

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:28.160
<i>But I'm going to lose my memories of her.</i>

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.950
<i>Even now, I can't remember her face.</i>

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:37.030
<i>I put a lot of thought into what
skills I wanted to start with!</i>

00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:41.870
<i>I gave up my life and all of my
memories of my old world as a price!</i>

00:00:42.550 --> 00:00:47.580
<i>So I want you to have a lot
of fun in your new world.</i>

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.720
<i>It's all up to you now, Kelvin!</i>

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:29.410
Where am I?

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:35.050
What is this?

00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:40.550
Is this another world?

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:46.450
<i>Pan-paka-pan!</i>

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.350
<i>Congratulations, My Lord!</i>

00:01:48.350 --> 00:01:54.200
<i>You were chosen at complete random to
be reincarnated into another world!</i>

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:58.150
<i>You don't have any memories
of your old world,</i>

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:02.350
<i>but you agreed to this before you
reincarnated, so don't worry!</i>

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.400
Reincarnated? Really?

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:08.830
Oh, crap! I really don't remember anything!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:12.230
What were you thinking,
pre-reincarnation me?

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:17.690
<i>This is a fantasy world full of clashing
blades and mages flinging magic!</i>

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:22.900
<i>Right now, you have the skills you
chose before you reincarnated.</i>

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.320
<i>Please look at this status
screen for the details.</i>

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:37.300
<b>Name: Kelvin
Level: 01 Title: None
HP: 010/010
MP: 020/020
Age: 23 | Strength: 1
Race: Human| Endurance: 1
Sex: Male | Agility: 3
Class: Summoner | Magic: 5
Luck: 4
Skills:
Summoning (Rank S) Spaces: 9 | Double Growth Rate
Green Magic (Rank F) | Double Skill Points
Appraising Eye (Rank S) |  Experience Sharing</b>

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:33.440
I picked a dedicated support type, huh?

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:37.290
And I get big stat boosts when I level up.

00:02:37.540 --> 00:02:40.910
Looks like I was a big gamer.

00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:44.300
I mean, I'm really excited right now!

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.260
Sorry for being mean, pre-reincarnation me.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:52.690
<b>Summoner</b>

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:52.210
A summoner, huh?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:57.040
<i>Start your adventure by
going to a nearby town!</i>

00:02:54.730 --> 00:03:01.780
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:02:57.040 --> 00:03:01.790
<i>There's a guild there.
You might want to register as an adventurer.</i>

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.800
All right, time to go.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:07.100
Off to the first town, then!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.510
<i>Let's-lah-go!</i>

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.300
We've been talking normally for a while now,
but, Miss Menu, are you coming, too?

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:21.130
<i>That's right. You lost your memories.</i>

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:22.880
<i>Look at this.</i>

00:03:24.590 --> 00:03:31.370
<i>Nobody's ever asked me, the Goddess of
Reincarnation, to become their servant before.</i>

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:34.190
<b>Name: Melfina
Level: Unknown Title: Unknown
HP: Unknown
MP: Unknown
Age: 1276 | Strength: Unknown
Race: Unknown | Endurance: Unknown
Sex: Female | Agility: Unknown
Class: Unknown | Magic: Unknown
Luck: Unknown</b>

00:03:31.370 --> 00:03:34.180
<i>Take responsibility, okay?</i>

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:41.590
What were you doing, pre-reincarnation me?!

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:47.280
<i>And the reason we can talk is that summoners
can communicate with their servants.</i>

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:53.580
<b>Name: Melfina
Level: Unknown Title: Unknown
HP: Unknown
MP: Unknown
Age: 1276 | Strength: Unknown
Race: Unknown | Endurance: Unknown
Sex: Female | Agility: Unknown
Class: Unknown | Magic: Unknown
Luck: Unknown</b>

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:53.580
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:57.990
<i>I guess I died in an accident.</i>

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:03.810
<i>Supposedly, it was a screw-up by
a god other than Melfina.</i>

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:07.920
<i>And that god went to Melfina,
the Goddess of Reincarnation,</i>

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.060
<i>to ask for her intervention.</i>

00:04:10.480 --> 00:04:15.950
<i>And when I saw her,
I fell in love, she says.</i>

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:19.430
<i>Right now, I can only hear her voice.</i>

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:24.630
<i>As soon as you chose your skills,
you asked me to make a contract.</i>

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:27.030
<i>"I fell in love with you! Come with me!"</i>

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.690
<i>You spent a whole hour telling
me how much you loved me!</i>

00:04:30.690 --> 00:04:35.930
<i>I've been at my job for a few centuries now,
and was getting a little tired of it...</i>

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:38.410
<i>So I agreed.</i>

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:41.180
<i>Even gods need to rest.</i>

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:42.840
<i>I think of it as a paid vacation.</i>

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:46.090
<i>I left my employees in charge,
so things will be fine.</i>

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:49.600
<i>I haven't taken a break in decades...</i>

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.390
<i>It's time to rest and recharge!</i>

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.930
<i>So my reincarnation is
like a vacation for you?</i>

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:57.230
<i>Then I want my memories back!</i>

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:02.340
<i>It was your decision to get rid of
your pre-reincarnation memories.</i>

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.890
<i>You said you needed more skill points,</i>

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:08.190
<i>and offered to exchange
your memories for them.</i>

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:11.690
<i>Why would I say that to a
girl I was in love with?</i>

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:15.040
<i>I can't be in love without my memories!</i>

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:19.100
<i>"Even without my memories,
I'll fall in love with you all over again!"</i>

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:21.480
<i>That was so sweet of you to say!</i>

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:26.010
<i>You sounded so sincere that I let you do it!</i>

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.960
<i>Congratulations!
Your relationship with me improved!</i>

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.270
<i>That's enough...</i>

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.080
I don't remember any of it,

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:37.360
but it feels like something I don't
want anyone else remembering either!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:49.520
<i>That caught me off guard, but I guess
Melfina was really my type, huh?</i>

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:54.800
<i>Now I think I want to see her.</i>

00:05:55.710 --> 00:06:00.570
If we've made a contract, can I summon you?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.600
<i>Not right now.</i>

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:06.590
<i>You don't have nearly enough
MP to summon me, My Lord.</i>

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:11.060
<i>I'm looking forward to seeing you grow, and
hearing how you'll tell me you love me next time.</i>

00:06:11.440 --> 00:06:13.430
I won't be doing that...

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:17.510
<i>We're almost at the guild, My Lord.</i>

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:20.390
And there's the Adventurer's Guild!

00:06:20.390 --> 00:06:22.470
It's an impressive building!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:25.440
Now, let's take a look inside!

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.200
What brings you here today?

00:06:27.520 --> 00:06:31.740
Please review these documents
and sign here and here.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.740
I'd like to issue a request for a job.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:36.340
Welcome back! This concludes your quest.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:38.680
Here's your reward!

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:46.210
Next!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.210
Hello!

00:06:48.210 --> 00:06:50.970
What brings you here today?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.510
I'd like to register as an adventurer.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:56.320
Registration, right? Understood!

00:06:56.320 --> 00:06:59.990
Just fill out this form.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.720
Do you need someone to write for you?

00:07:02.110 --> 00:07:03.320
I'm fine, thanks.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:08.340
<i>I got the skills "Understand Language"
and "Literacy" when I reincarnated.</i>

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:10.810
<i>Wait a moment.</i>

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.810
<i>Do you intend to write your
class down as "Summoner"?</i>

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.460
<i>What? Is that bad?</i>

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:27.800
<b>Holy Empire of Deramis</b>

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:27.800
<b>Militant Nation of Trycen</b>

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:27.800
<b>Beast Country
of Gaun</b>

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:27.800
<b>{*} Town of Parth</b>

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:27.800
<b>Water Country of Toraj</b>

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:22.470
<i>Summoner is an ultra-rare job.
There's typically at most one per nation.</i>

00:07:22.470 --> 00:07:26.810
<i>If they find out you're a summoner,</i>

00:07:26.810 --> 00:07:30.660
<i>this nation's rulers will be
quick to take an interest in you.</i>

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.580
<i>I see. I don't want that.</i>

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:37.250
<i>I'll put my class down as Green Mage, then.</i>

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.980
Kelvin, right?

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.630
Just a moment.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.380
<i>I was lucky enough to end
up in a fantasy world.</i>

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.080
<i>I want to enjoy my freedom as long as I can.</i>

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:53.420
<i>I'll keep the fact that
I'm a summoner a secret.</i>

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:01.620
Here you are. Your guild membership.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:07.330
You just registered,
so you're starting at Rank F.

00:08:07.610 --> 00:08:11.620
Here at the guild,
we receive jobs from all over,

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:15.550
and we divide them into different
ranks for different adventurers.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:20.750
So right now, I can only take F-rank jobs?

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.870
You can take jobs up to one rank
higher than your current one.

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:28.400
But if you fail, you'll have
to pay a contract penalty.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.110
So be careful.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:35.100
<i>So I can't just go around taking
all the high ranking jobs, huh?</i>

00:08:35.520 --> 00:08:40.170
If you complete ten jobs in a row,
you'll go up an Adventurer Rank.

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:44.550
You don't get extra points for
taking jobs above your rank.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.490
But once you reach rank C,
you'll start having to take exams.

00:08:48.800 --> 00:08:50.370
So be ready for that!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:51.360
Okay.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.460
Got any good jobs for a new adventurer?

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:59.700
Hmm, how about these?

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.910
Defeat three blue slimes?

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:07.050
Harvest herbs?

00:09:07.570 --> 00:09:11.320
Find cat? Special job?

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:15.310
<i>My Lord, why not go after the blue slimes,</i>

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:17.780
<i>and make a contract with
one while you're at it?</i>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:21.330
<i>It'd be the perfect monster
for your first summoning.</i>

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.980
<i>So we're thinking the same thing, huh?</i>

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:26.500
<i>I can't wait to try my summoning.</i>

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.780
<i>Of course, in a place with nobody around.</i>

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.600
I'll take the blue slime quest!

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:36.480
This one, right?

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:37.910
Okay.

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:39.040
And also...

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:47.020
<b>Name: Kelvin
Level: 01 Title: None
HP: 010/010
MP: 020/020
Age: 23 | Strength: 1
Race: Human| Endurance: 1
Sex: Male | Agility: 3
Class: Summoner | Magic: 5
Luck: 4
Skills:
Summoning (Rank S) Spaces: 9 | Double Growth Rate
Green Magic (Rank F) | Double Skill Points
Appraising Eye (Rank S) |  Experience Sharing</b>

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:47.020
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.070
Thank you!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.700
<i>A wooden rod, huh?</i>

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:56.340
<i>It has basically no physical attack, but it
does have a small amount of magic.</i>

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:58.660
<i>It'll help your magic!</i>

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:02.200
That's most of my money spent.

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:06.200
Time to go and earn enough
money for tonight's inn!

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:11.970
Maybe it was because I followed
the path to get to Parth,

00:10:11.970 --> 00:10:14.120
or maybe I was just lucky...

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.870
But I didn't run into any monsters.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.870
<i>Blue slimes!</i>

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:27.560
<i>Use Appraising Eye on them, My Lord!</i>

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:31.880
I see it...

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:33.850
So this is Appraising Eye, huh?

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:38.820
<b>Level 01       Title: None</b>

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:38.820
<b>Age: 0 | Strength: 1
Race: Blue Slime| Endurance: 1
Sex: None | Agility: 1
Class:  | Magic: 2
Luck: 2</b>

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:38.820
<b>Skills:
Physical Attack Resistance</b>

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.850
Looks like I can read the
data about my target.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.950
<i>Your Appraising Eye is Rank S.</i>

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:47.690
<i>You can appraise creatures up to 100 levels
above you, and items up to Rank S.</i>

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.290
<i>That's most anything, right?</i>

00:10:51.350 --> 00:10:52.270
<i>Wait.</i>

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:58.790
<i>If I couldn't read your stats, Melfina,
does that mean you're above level 100?</i>

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.940
<i>I am a goddess, you know.</i>

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:08.060
<i>Sheesh... How much MP do
I need to summon you?</i>

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.870
<i>Wait, we're getting off topic.</i>

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:12.020
<i>I need to deal with these blue slimes!</i>

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:20.630
<i>First, I want to make my
summoner contract work.</i>

00:11:21.190 --> 00:11:22.690
<i>How do I do that?</i>

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:27.620
<i>You need your target's consent.
And then it's up to you.</i>

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.780
<i>Consent, huh?</i>

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.860
<i>Do I talk to the slime to get it to consent?</i>

00:11:34.540 --> 00:11:36.920
<i>For monsters that can't understand speech,</i>

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.050
<i>attack and weaken them, but don't kill them.</i>

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:44.510
<i>Then use the contract, and they'll consent.</i>

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:47.130
<i>"As if it wants to join the party!"
You know?</i>

00:11:47.420 --> 00:11:50.570
<i>You seem to know a lot about games yourself.</i>

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:53.650
<i>Magic would probably just defeat it.</i>

00:11:54.090 --> 00:11:55.940
<i>I'll fight with the Wooden Rod.</i>

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.140
<i>My Lord! Are you okay?</i>

00:12:11.480 --> 00:12:13.040
I was a bit careless...

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.760
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:18.990
<i>I thought slimes were the weakest monsters!
And easy to defeat!</i>

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.700
<i>"Hey, hey! What's wrong? Come on!"</i>

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:26.180
<i>I bet that's what it's saying!</i>

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:30.360
<i>It's... strong!</i>

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:32.000
<i>I'll use magic.</i>

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:35.230
<i>No, if I defeat it, I can't get my contract!</i>

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:51.980
<i>Watch carefully!</i>

00:12:51.980 --> 00:12:54.140
<i>It's not that fast!</i>

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:58.580
<i>It's really agile at dodging my attacks,</i>

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:01.750
<i>but if I can move faster than it can...</i>

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:13.820
<i>I'm not done yet!</i>

00:13:23.140 --> 00:13:23.950
Well?

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:28.080
It's got 3 HP left!

00:13:28.790 --> 00:13:30.100
Nice!

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.460
Time to try that contract.

00:13:31.460 --> 00:13:33.530
<i>Extend your hand.</i>

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:39.390
It feels like something
is draining from my body.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.530
Is this safe?

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:44.900
<i>It's probably all the magic you used.</i>

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:50.170
<i>Contracts use half your remaining MP,
whether you succeed or not.</i>

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:52.890
You should've told me that beforehand!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.150
Whatever. Did it work?

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:16.880
<i>Congratulations!
The contract was a success!</i>

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:18.740
So it worked, then?

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:22.830
<i>The monster you just made a
contract with has no name yet.</i>

00:14:22.830 --> 00:14:25.710
<i>Why not give it one?</i>

00:14:28.650 --> 00:14:29.810
Okay!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.560
From now on, you're Clotho!

00:14:33.110 --> 00:14:34.960
Glad to have you on board!

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:37.390
What?

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:40.520
I can sense what it's feeling!

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:43.630
Is it happy?

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.860
<i>You can communicate, even without words.</i>

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:50.820
<i>Servants can also communicate
with each other, too!</i>

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:55.220
I guess I should call
it the servant network.

00:14:55.220 --> 00:14:57.100
It'll be helpful in battle!

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.660
Now, time to try summoning.

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:04.910
If I used half my MP in that contract,
I still have 10 left.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:06.770
Is that enough?

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:09.580
<i>Yes, for a slime of this level.</i>

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.340
Come, Clotho!

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.550
That's my first objective complete.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:22.730
Now, time for that job!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.460
<i>You're making Clotho kill its own kind.</i>

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:28.220
<i>You're a monster, My Lord!</i>

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:36.030
Slimes grow by eating weaker slimes,
so it's okay?

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:38.730
Clotho, it's okay if you don't want to.

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:41.540
Okay! Okay!

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:44.580
You're free to absorb any slimes you defeat.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:48.750
But we're desynthesizing the slime
cores to prove we defeated them.

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:59.780
Time to try some green magic.

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:03.330
Clotho. I'll attack one with magic.

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.630
You take the other.

00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:06.970
Show me how you fight.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:11.900
<i>With the buff it's getting from
my supplying it with magic,</i>

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.640
<i>it'll be stronger than
an ordinary blue slime.</i>

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:19.760
<i>Melfina taught me a few
basic green magic spells.</i>

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:22.090
<i>Between contracting with
Clotho and summoning it,</i>

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.620
<i>I only have enough MP for one shot.</i>

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.590
<i>But I have healing items, too.</i>

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.540
<i>I can take some slimes.</i>

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.330
Wind!

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.080
Clotho!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.330
Yes!

00:16:44.330 --> 00:16:48.550
Clotho's a lot faster
than before the contract.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.620
It has a face now, too...

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:54.280
<i>A S-Class Summoner's enhancement
adds +100 to all stats!</i>

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.870
<b>Name: Clotho</b>

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.870
<b>Level 01                    Title: None</b>

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.870
<b>Skills:
Physical Attack Resistance</b>

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.870
<b>Age: 0 | Strength: 101
Race: Blue Slime| Endurance: 101
Sex: None | Agility: 102
Class:  | Magic: 101
Luck: 102</b>

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.380
It's way too strong!

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:06.390
That's why countries really
want summoners, huh?

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:10.220
Even a level 1 slime is this strong.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:17.550
<i>Let me add that you're currently the
only Rank S summoner, My Lord.</i>

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.750
<i>The others are much weaker,
Rank B or Rank C at best,</i>

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:24.130
<i>and their stat boosts are only +10 or +20.</i>

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:25.410
Seriously?

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:29.870
It's almost not fair that I
have this skill at level 1.

00:17:36.050 --> 00:17:37.080
What?

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.650
What's that? You found another
one over there and took it out?

00:17:42.380 --> 00:17:43.700
Way to go, Clotho!

00:17:46.470 --> 00:17:49.880
That's our three blue slimes!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:55.840
Good work, Clotho.

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:03.280
<i>You, too. Good work with your
first contract and fight.</i>

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:10.740
<b>Name: Clotho
Level: 01 Title: None
HP: 105/105
MP: 100/100
Age: 0 | Strength: 101
Race: Blue Slime| Endurance: 101
Sex: None | Agility: 102
Class:  | Magic: 101
Luck: 102</b>

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:10.740
<b>Black Summoner</b>

00:18:11.220 --> 00:18:13.590
We got our pay for the job,

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.440
so we have enough to afford
food and a room tonight.

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:22.430
If you'd given me more money at the start,
I could've bought better equipment.

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:27.600
<i>My Lord, you wouldn't be able to enjoy
making your way in this world like that.</i>

00:18:27.600 --> 00:18:29.870
<i>Actually, I figured out just how much money</i>

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:33.770
<i>you'd need to buy this
world's starting equipment.</i>

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:35.090
Thanks.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:40.370
Now, the inn that Ange from the guild
recommended is this way, right?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.340
<i>Looks like a slaver.</i>

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:55.670
<i>Slaves, huh?</i>

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:58.350
<i>I've got summon slots open.</i>

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:00.950
<i>It would be a good way
to strengthen my party.</i>

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:05.580
I just got something
special in the other day.

00:19:05.580 --> 00:19:07.100
Look at this.

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.660
An elf.

00:19:09.520 --> 00:19:12.770
They're really rare!
They never leave their villages!

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:18.020
She's a little thin, but all elves
are supposed to be beautiful.

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:20.640
She'd shine with a little polish.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:21.890
Right?

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:26.020
Unfortunately, she's a mixed-blood half-elf.

00:19:26.020 --> 00:19:29.610
But I was lucky to get her
at the price I did.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:46.980
The Spirit's Song. This is it, right?

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:53.320
<i>Ange's #1 recommendation for new,
cash-strapped adventurers!</i>

00:19:53.320 --> 00:19:54.420
Let's go!

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:56.440
Hello!

00:19:56.440 --> 00:19:58.620
You a customer?

00:19:58.620 --> 00:20:00.840
Welcome to the Spirit's Song.

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:03.050
I'd like a room for the night.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:07.810
Sure thing.
If you like it, stay another night.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.510
I'm Claire. Nice to meet you.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:11.890
Kelvin.

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:15.810
I was told the meals are delicious here.

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:19.410
You arrived at the perfect time.

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:21.610
I'm just getting dinner ready!

00:20:21.610 --> 00:20:25.750
I'll cook you up something delicious,
so for now, get some rest in your room!

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:31.210
I knew it was coming,

00:20:31.210 --> 00:20:32.910
but there's no bath, huh?

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:37.720
There are no baths, except in the castles
of kings or mansions of nobles.

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:42.680
Commoners wash themselves in the river,
or wipe themselves down with hot towels.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:48.740
It'll be tough for a Japanese
person to go without baths.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.720
Someday... I'll live in a house with a bath!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:02.160
I haven't eaten since I came to this world.

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.720
<i>I smell something good, don't you?</i>

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:09.420
Okay, time for my first
meal in this new world!

00:21:09.690 --> 00:21:15.120
<i>My Lord, get to a level where you
can summon me as soon as you can!</i>

00:21:15.120 --> 00:21:19.660
<i>I can't wait to eat human food myself!</i>

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.400
Yeah, leave it to me!

00:21:22.920 --> 00:21:24.940
Go on, eat up!

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.170
That looks so good!

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:34.760
<i>And thus began my life in another world.</i>

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:40.600
<i>Melfina, a goddess whom I could only hear,
not see, and Clotho, the blue slime,</i>

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:41.820
<i>are my companions now.</i>

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:46.710
<i>What comrades and powerful foes await me?</i>

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:56.070
<i>You, the person I was
before I became Kelvin...</i>

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.170
<i>You chose the job of Summoner for me.</i>

00:22:00.870 --> 00:22:04.520
<i>I'll make the best use of it
in this world that I can!</i>

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:09.970
<b>EP 01: Reincarnated Without Memories</b>
